					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target: ST 28, DX 11, IQ 8, HT 15, HP 36. Increased ST +18 (180) for ST 28. Increased DX +1 (B15, 20/level, 20) for DX 11 -- an Immortal is built with noticeably tighter tolerances than a Warrior. Decreased IQ -2 (B16, 20/level, -40) for IQ 8 -- dim but genuinely capable of following tactics, matching framework.md's own description. Increased HT +5 (B15, 10/level, 50) for HT 15. Extra Hit Points +8 (B16, 2/level, 16) on top of the ST-28 base of 28, for HP 36. 180+20-40+50+16 = 226.",
