		{
			"id": "TxC4miEKm6kzjlzpC",
			"name": "Body Lens: Deathmark",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Deathmarks are the dynasty's snipers and infiltrators, phased out of reality between shots and reappearing to deliver a single, precise kill. Codex background is explicit that a Deathmark carries far more individual initiative than a Warrior, but is still built as a specialised tool rather than a full personality.\n\nDesign: 252 (Attribute Modifiers) + 300 (Necrodermis DR 60, 5/level) = 552 points, added to Necron Physiology's 224 for 776 points of physiology and body alone. See the Deathmark template.",
