					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target: ST 26, DX 13, IQ 9, HT 14, HP 32. Increased ST +16 (160) for ST 26. Increased DX +3 (B15, 20/level, 60) for DX 13 -- a hunter-pattern chassis built for marksmanship over brute plating. Decreased IQ -1 (B16, 20/level, -20) for IQ 9 -- sharper than an Immortal, enough for solo infiltration work. Increased HT +4 (40) for HT 14. Extra Hit Points +6 (12) on top of the ST-26 base of 26, for HP 32. 160+60-20+40+12 = 252.",
