			"name": "Body Lens: Lychguard",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Lychguard are the personal bodyguards of a dynasty's nobility -- hand-picked, heavily armoured, and sworn to interpose themselves between their charge and any threat with an honour that borders on ritual. Codex background and Crowley's Twice-Dead King both treat Lychguard as visibly more \"present\" and dutiful than a rank-and-file Warrior, without the full personality of a Lord.\n\nDesign: 306 (Attribute Modifiers) + 450 (Necrodermis DR 90, 5/level) = 756 points, added to Necron Physiology's 224 for 980 points of physiology and body alone. See the Lychguard template.",
