		{
			"id": "TpRwoC3LHW8JNpV77",
			"name": "Body Lens: Flayed One",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Flayed Ones were once ordinary Necrons whose reanimation matrices degraded into a compulsion to flay and wear the flesh of the living -- the Flayer Curse. Their necrodermis is unremarkable, the same tier as a Warrior's; what sets them apart is entirely psychological (see the Mind: Flayer Curse package) and behavioural (stealth and murder over line-infantry combat).\n\nDesign: 172 (Attribute Modifiers) + 10 (Basic Move +2) + 250 (Necrodermis DR 50, 5/level) = 432 points, added to Necron Physiology's 224 for 656 points of physiology and body alone. See the Flayed One template.",
