		{
			"id": "TiS_21wBfObJfXts_",
			"name": "Body Lens: Noble (Lord/Overlord)",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Necron Lord or Overlord kept a full personality through the biotransference and the long sleep, for better or worse: Codex background, Rath's The Infinite and the Divine and Crowley's Twice- Dead King all portray Necron nobility as vividly individual -- scheming, proud, sometimes darkly funny -- in a way the lesser castes simply are not.\n\nDesign: 450 (Attribute Modifiers) + 500 (Necrodermis DR 100, 5/level) = 950 points, added to Necron Physiology's 224 for 1,174 points of physiology and body alone, before the Mind: Noble Personality package and skills -- already above framework.md's Astartes tier (550-800) before either are added, matching the instruction that an Overlord belongs at or above that band. See the Necron Overlord template.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Necrons"
			],
			"container_type": "meta_trait",
			"children": [
