					"name": "Attribute Modifiers (Noble)",
					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target: ST 34 (strength ladder in framework.md), HT 15, HP 44, DX 13, IQ 14, a typical Overlord rather than the extremes; a GM building a specific, especially large or small Lord should adjust ST directly. Increased ST +24 (B14, 10/level, 240) for ST 34. Increased DX +3 (B15, 20/level, 60) for DX 13. Increased IQ +4 (B16, 20/level, 80) for IQ 14 -- a full, cunning personality, on a par with a human genius. Increased HT +5 (50) for HT 15. Extra Hit Points +10 (B16, 2/level, 20) on top of the ST-34 base of 34, for HP 44. 240+60+80+50+20 = 450.",
