			"name": "Body Lens: Cryptek",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Crypteks are the dynasty's technosorcerers -- keepers of half- understood pre-biotransference science that looks, to everyone else, exactly like sorcery. Codex background, Rath's and Crowley's novels alike treat Cryptek genius as real and dangerous, and their necrodermis is built lighter than a soldier's to leave room for the arcana they carry.\n\nDesign: 372 (Attribute Modifiers) + 300 (Necrodermis DR 60, 5/level) = 672 points, added to Necron Physiology's 224 for 896 points of physiology and body alone, before a Discipline lens, the Mind: Cryptek Genius package and skills. See the Cryptek template.",
